Muqova ustida oq doira Ivory'da muqovadan "uzilib" qolgandek, Noir'da
yorqin dog' bo'lib ko'rinardi (egasi, 2026-10 surat).

- NovaIconButton.glass (sukut: false — boshqa tugmalar o'zgarmaydi):
  mavzu sirt rangi 62% + 14 px blur, mavzu hoshiyasi va soyasi.
  Ivory'da iliq ivory (sof oq emas), Noir'da to'q.
- Profil sarlavhasidagi tugmalar (Settings, "yana", orqaga) shisha.
  VIP001, statistika, tahrirlash, QR/share va pastki panelga
  tegilmagan.
- profile_hero_top_test: Ivory va Noir — Settings shisha (blur,
  shaffoflik .4–.9, mavzu sirt rangi).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WqgHSnzY8F5vsV7piKkJh7
